  "document": "Bertha, Duchess of Lorraine\nBertha of Lorraine( or Bertha of Swabia)( b.c. 1123/30 – d. 1194/ 5) was a member of the Hohenstaufen dynasty. She was the daughter of Frederick II, Duke of Swabia and, through marriage to Matthias I duke of Lorraine, she was duchess of Lorraine( c.1138-1176)."
